10 REM THE RUN ORDER OF A SHOW (FOOTLIGHT_RULES.H FL6): THE SLIDE AFTER
11 REM SLIDE C OF N IN MODE M. M = 0 ADVANCES TO THE NEXT AND ENDS (0)
12 REM AFTER THE LAST, M = 1 HOLDS THE SLIDE SHOWN, M = 2 ADVANCES AND
13 REM LOOPS BACK TO THE FIRST AFTER THE LAST. N IS 1 .. 999 AND C 1 .. N;
14 REM ANYTHING ELSE IS REFUSED.
20 INPUT C, N, M
30 IF N < 1 THEN 300
40 IF N > 999 THEN 300
50 IF C < 1 THEN 300
60 IF C > N THEN 300
70 IF M = 1 THEN 200
80 IF M = 0 THEN 120
90 IF M = 2 THEN 160
100 GOTO 300
120 IF C < N THEN 180
130 PRINT 0
140 GOTO 310
160 IF C < N THEN 180
170 PRINT 1
175 GOTO 310
180 PRINT C + 1
190 GOTO 310
200 PRINT C
210 GOTO 310
300 PRINT "REFUSED"
310 END
